            "body": "> The documentation doesn't show how to remap the treesitter bindings, only the LSP bindings.\n> \n> Or are they the same?\n\nPlease see [this comment](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/2338#issuecomment-4175729914) (TL;DR: there is no public method for tree-sitter based incremental selection; neovim/neovim#38211). That's something that I try to figure out how to do in the best way (combination of concise and future proof).",
